24 \\\\ 7 & -7 & -21\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-130313/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "8feeacff-b07d-5f98-a765-4d8571674a7a"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-130313"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-130446/selection/1f1f2fe9df6485d5cdc7916416b2f79699d874348406e639d5daec02cb2e57e6" :answer/id #uuid "12caa388-0d74-555f-a2e4-090f1c84bced" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "II and III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130446/selection/95f63c11f99a5015c1f73558576052145e00c1cfbb1718f78cf554be0ab200f9" :answer/id #uuid "0512ff9e-d02a-5795-a20a-a2c0aee0d6a9" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and II only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130446/selection/5b26512916f768e66a2b0af106e5aa3e2ff7ee012277d9669a26d349c343f77b" :answer/id #uuid "ee2c1fee-2568-529b-99c1-a0c082fe9d57" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130446/selection/6a87b4860f595a380edef797b2cc43b24d4896fc51da713259b980588721456c" :answer/id #uuid "a2e50a0e-db8c-55f3-84dc-49e8eb1c1375" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130446/selection/df67a18079e3b7b726c109ae1bf07ae161d9f6d37a928c50361c8787d74f7981" :answer/id #uuid "5a134db0-33ff-5af3-90fc-739c59a88ae4" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "II only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130446/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "c8308f41-f531-5896-96da-f280b054d33f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-130446/selection/5b26512916f768e66a2b0af106e5aa3e2ff7ee012277d9669a26d349c343f77b" :answer-field/choices ["q-130446/selection/1f1f2fe9df6485d5cdc7916416b2f79699d874348406e639d5daec02cb2e57e6" "q-130446/selection/95f63c11f99a5015c1f73558576052145e00c1cfbb1718f78cf554be0ab200f9" "q-130446/selection/5b26512916f768e66a2b0af106e5aa3e2ff7ee012277d9669a26d349c343f77b" "q-130446/selection/6a87b4860f595a380edef797b2cc43b24d4896fc51da713259b980588721456c" "q-130446/selection/df67a18079e3b7b726c109ae1bf07ae161d9f6d37a928c50361c8787d74f7981"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-130446" :question/id #uuid "dbc4b4ed-d2ff-5bf8-96ba-ad5cf7b8d58e" :question/math-academy-id "q-130446" :question/problem "Given that $A,B,$ and $C$ are $4\\times 4$ matrices which of the following statements are always true? \n\n- ${A}^{2}B=A(AB)$\n- $A(B-C)=AB-CA$\n- $B(CA)=(CB)A$" :question/worked-solution "Let's consider the statements one by one.\n\n- Statement I is true. Matrix multiplication is associative and  ${A}^{2}B=AAB=A(AB)$ is always true.\n\n- Statement II is false.  Matrix multiplication is distributive and  $A(B-C)=AB-AC.$ However, matrix multiplication is not commutative, so $AC\\ne CA$ in general and therefore $A(B-C)\\ne AB-CA$, in general.\n\n- Statement III is false. Matrix multiplication is associative and  $B(CA)=(BC)A.$ However, matrix multiplication is not commutative, so $BC\\ne CB$ in general and therefore $B(CA)\\ne (CB)A$, in general.\n\nTherefore, only statement  I is true." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-130446/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "5a870c4a-daa5-5df2-8968-d8bf9ac0bd75"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-130446"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-319938/field-1/3acacd5649f6ffeeb0b5cea8a9d779239286b47fe59fea610e89b63949bd5e5b" :answer/id #uuid "9cbbffd2-c482-515d-8bcc-7e95b417ee3e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-65" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-319938/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "cc6da346-ec1e-523a-acd9-74dfb0bb9e66" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-319938/field-1/3acacd5649f6ffeeb0b5cea8a9d779239286b47fe59fea610e89b63949